</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>标准学制内或经申请核准后延长一年内可享受。</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>导师津贴</span></p><p><span>（100%）</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>15000元/年</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>无</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>国家奖学金</span></p><p><span>（约3%）</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>20000元/年</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>标准学制内或经申请核准后延长一年内可享受，按学年一次性发放。</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\"><section><section><p><span>学校奖学金</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学业奖学金</span></p><p><span>（100%）</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>20000元/年</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>标准学制内或经申请核准后延长一年内可享受，按学年一次性发放。</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>研究生</span></p><p><span>校设奖学金</span></p><p><span><span>（约10%）</span></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2000-</span></p><p><span>50000元/年</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>分为单项奖和综合奖，综合奖最高50000元/人，每年评选不超过10人，以实际评奖通知为准。</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>拔尖创新人才奖学金</span></p></section></section></td><td colspan=\"2\"><section><section><p><span>特等奖：7.7万元、一等奖：3.7万元、二等奖：1.7万元。按第一学年（新生）、其他学年（老生）分类评定，主要评定标准包括毕业院校（新生）、发表学术论文情况等。具体评定标准、办法以学校及学院当年度发布的相关文件通知为准。</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>境外学习奖学金</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>待定</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>获奖比例、标准以国际交流合作部的通知为准。</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>研究生三助酬金</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>10000元/年</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>标准学制内均可申请。一年按10个月发放，每月每岗最高不超过1000元。</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>社会奖学金</span></p></section></section></td><td colspan=\"3\"><section><section><p><span>社会奖学金按照学校与设奖方签订的协议书执行，以实际评奖通知为准（面向所有博士生）。</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>6</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>截止时间：</span><span><strong><span>2026年7月3日</span></strong></span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span>报名入口：</span></p></li></ul></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OGZsmgwyN0hKAVRpqTs8nF0bdO6MslgeXGO1NLaR6YFDhB9umykFGN9rg8pClsWeicTBiaAoGyGGicyCHW36hugAIqjzVTObzVhicW6HF7EXp0M/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>https://csse.szu.edu.cn/SummerCamp2026</span></p><p><span>（仅限本次暑期学校报名）</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><ul><li><p><span>具体流程</span></p></li></ul></section><section><p><span>① 提前与意向导师沟通交流（如有导师推荐信，可获优先遴选入营资格）；</span></p><p><span>② 预报名系统中完成报名；</span></p><p><span>③ 报名成功后，加入2027级暑期夏令营通知QQ群（见下方二维码），进群后备注“姓名-本科院校”的格式；</span></p><p><span>④ 学院将根据申请材料综合考虑，确定夏令营入围名单，通知学生参加暑期夏令营；结营后将根据暑期学校期间综合表现突出的学员发放优秀学员证书。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>7</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式与其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>直博生接收</span></p></li></ul></section><section><section><p><span>① 直博生的招收对象为具有推荐免试攻读研究生资格的校内外优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>② 直博生的标准学习年限为5年；</span></p><p><span>③ 申请直博生的推免生应同时在推免服务系统和我校博士招生系统进行网上报名，具体通知将在深圳大学研招网发布：</span><span><span>https://yz.szu.edu.cn/bszs/gg.htm</span></span></p></section></section><section><ul><li><p><span>联系方式</span></p></li></ul></section><section><section><p><span>① 咨询电话：</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>熊老师 0755-26534301（硕士）</span></p><p><span>姜老师 0755-26530131（博士）</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>② 电子邮箱：</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>熊老师 xiongdr@szu.edu.cn（硕士）</span></p><p><span>姜老师 gracejiang@szu.edu.cn（博士）</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>③ 2027年深大计软暑期夏令营通知群</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OGZsmgwyN0gYh7hsuKYDOUo0q8CJDyibxumHnFlBUjibPibGA5Z81ic2Ceic8MJNMJLrAD1WML65bd2MITJ5EAiauyzXtkIqNicfdtqpY02FtcybQA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>欢迎有意在粤港澳大湾区、在鹏城大展宏图的优秀学生加入我们</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>立鸿鹄之志</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>展骐骥之跃</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>圆理想之梦</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OGZsmgwyN0hj04vvLy2OIdC4pBtRZicJkibxVS1s9yLbLicoUnNbrujicfC3lAyyaRAHKwjNkGu4pl78v7DE6Qe6USZcPntUZsAFqm2hQebibfXk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OGZsmgwyN0ia3jsprhIefCUicW63Z6sJRlc3kT7svEnoLGSUI1vBZANOvXfzDsHbzcibULpxxkKRal5nD